# Java backend (lc-checker-v2-svc)

## Layout

- Vertical-slice packages under `com.lc.v2.checker` (`stage/`, `api/`, `infra/`, `pipeline/`)
- Config knobs in `src/main/resources/application.yml`; secrets only in `.env`

## Persistence

- Schema prefix **`lc_v3`** in all SQL (`SessionStore`, `VisionExtractCache`, `schema.sql`)
- Session outputs → `pipeline_steps`; officer decisions → `officer_actions`
- Vision cross-session cache → `lc_v3.vision_extract_cache` (`vision.cache.enabled: true`)

## LLM

- **Text rules**: Spring AI `ChatClient` (MiniMax via `application.yml`)
- **Vision**: `RestClient` only — not Spring AI ChatClient
- Qwen3-family: `enable_thinking: false` at **top-level** request body
- Prompts: `src/main/resources/prompts/` (`.st` files); rules in `rules/catalog.yml`

## Local dev

- `make svc-watch` for hot-reload (Java + resources)
- `PRESETS_DIR` set by Makefile → `test/cases/`
- MinIO optional: `S3FileStore` uses in-process `PdfBytesCache` when `STORAGE_MINIO_REQUIRED=false`

## Do not

- Point Mac local svc at Ubuntu MinIO/Langfuse without reachable network
- Use `lc_v2` schema in new SQL
- Commit `.env` or rotate secrets into yaml
